{% extends "_page.html.j2" %}
{% from "_parts.html.j2" import contact_link %}
{% block title %}Our sources · {{ product }}{% endblock %}
{% block path %}/sources{% endblock %}
{% block description %}The {{ source_count }} free and open sources {{ product }} reads, and how it uses each one.{% endblock %}
{% block heading %}Our sources{% endblock %}
{% block lede %}We read {{ source_count }} free and open sources from {{ country_count }} countries, only through the feeds and data they publish for that purpose. Each one is used only in the way its terms allow.{% endblock %}
{% block body %}
<section>
<h2 class="serif">How we use a source</h2>
<ul class="bullets">
<li><b>Open data:</b> official data turned into short reports with fixed templates, keeping the publisher's values unchanged and crediting it.</li>
<li><b>Open licence:</b> published under an open licence; we summarise it and credit it.</li>
<li><b>Facts:</b> we take the facts it reports and write about them in our own words; its wording never appears on our site.</li>
<li><b>Link only:</b> we link to its reports and use their headlines only to recognise reports of the same event. No AI ever reads them.</li>
</ul>
<p>We never fetch from sites behind a paywall, we honour every site's robots.txt and opt-outs from text and data mining, and we never show a source's images or logos.</p>
</section>
<section>
<h2 class="serif">The full list</h2>
<div class="table-scroll">
<table class="src-table">
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Source</th><th scope="col">Country</th><th scope="col">Language</th><th scope="col">Use</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
{% for s in source_rows %}
<tr><td><a href="{{ s.homepage }}" rel="noopener">{{ s.name }}</a></td><td>{{ s.country }}</td><td>{{ s.language }}</td><td><span class="use">{{ {'data': 'Open data', 'open_license': 'Open licence', 'facts_only': 'Facts', 'link_only': 'Link only'}[s.use] }}</span></td></tr>
{% endfor %}
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
<section>
<h2 class="serif">For publishers</h2>
<p>If you publish one of these sources and want us to change how we use it, or stop, write to {{ contact_link() }}. We answer within 48 hours, and a source can be switched off at once.</p>
</section>
{% endblock %}
